      {
        "target" : "文件系统扩展可让你无需内核层级访问权限即可扩展macOS文件系统功能。",
        "filename" : "Localizable.loctable",
        "language" : "zh_CN"
      },
      {
        "filename" : "Localizable.loctable",
        "target" : "File System extensions allow you to extend the file system functionality of macOS without requiring kernel-level access.",
